    "detailed_description": "A Walking Simulator Adventure in a randomized world where every step counts!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Mind your steps! Your steps decrease as you go: make sure you grab stepping flowers and other items so you don't run out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Explore the world of Omrand made of five distinct biomes!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Increase your Heart Points to defeat evil creatures and face your ultimate foe: the Heart of the Corruption!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Meet friendly NPCs that can help you on your travels!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Gather Coins to buy items and various things!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Discover secrets and take on side quests!",
